{"id":3180,"date":"2019-05-07T08:27:38","date_gmt":"2019-05-07T08:27:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=3180"},"modified":"2019-09-09T22:48:00","modified_gmt":"2019-09-09T22:48:00","slug":"venue-and-useful-information","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/edinburgh2019\/venue-and-useful-information\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue and Useful information"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1>Contacts<\/h1>\n<p align=\"justify\">For all enquiries relating to the workshop, please email <a href=\"mailto:info@swat4ls.org\">info@swat4ls.org<\/a>.<br \/>\nFor updates, please visit <a href=\"http:\/\/swat4ls.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the swat4ls blog<\/a> or register to the feed (<a href=\"http:\/\/swat4ls.blogspot.com\/feeds\/posts\/default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Atom<\/a>).<br \/>\nAn emergency phone number will be provided after registration.<\/p>\n<p><a name=\"location\"><\/a><\/p>\n<h1>Location<\/h1>\n<h3>Postgraduate Centre, Heriot-Watt University<\/h3>\n<p>All SWAT4HCLS events will take place at the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.hw.ac.uk\/uk\/edinburgh\/centre-for-postgraduates.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Postgraduate Centre<\/a> of Heriot-Watt University in Edinburgh.<\/p>\n<p>Details on how to reach the Postgraduate Centre will be added to this page soon. Google Maps location: <a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/NkeZhzh3LEj6P6fz8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h1>Hotels<\/h1>\n<p>Edinburgh is a popular tourist destination and consequently has a large number and range of accommodation options. SWAT4HCLS does not have any specific arrangements with any of the B&amp;Bs, guest houses and hotels listed below, but provide this information simply for the convenience of SWAT4HCLS attendees.<\/p>\n<p>The usual sources, such as <a title=\"Tripadvisor\" href=\"http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tripadvisor.co.uk<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.booking.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">booking.com<\/a> will provide extensive lists of available accommodation in Edinburgh.<\/p>\n<p>A <strong>site maintained by Edinburgh University<\/strong> of potential accommodation can be found <a href=\"http:\/\/www.edinburghfirst.co.uk\/for-accommodation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Contacts For all enquiries relating to the workshop, please email info@swat4ls.org. For updates, please visit the swat4ls blog or register to the feed (Atom). An emergency phone number will be provided after registration. Location Postgraduate Centre, Heriot-Watt University All SWAT4HCLS &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/edinburgh2019\/venue-and-useful-information\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3169,"parent":3165,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3180","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3180","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3180"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3180\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3191,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3180\/revisions\/3191"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3165"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.sw